    return `<rect x="${f1(x)}" y="${f1(y)}" width="${f1(w)}" height="${f1(h)}" fill="url(#${u}-fv)" opacity="${op || 1}"/><rect x="${f1(x)}" y="${f1(y)}" width="${f1(w)}" height="${f1(h)}" fill="url(#${u}-wv)"/>`;
